1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Fifth Episode
The Ghost Ship

15
00:02:24,421 --> 00:02:26,412
A ghost ship!

16
00:02:56,101 --> 00:02:59,013
What?! Has the ghost ship attacked again?

17
00:02:59,141 --> 00:03:01,336
That's already the sixth ship to sink!

18
00:03:01,501 --> 00:03:03,810
What could this ghost ship be?

19
00:03:03,941 --> 00:03:06,535
A sailor who survived
the shipwreck reported...

20
00:03:06,581 --> 00:03:09,891
...that the ghost ship was
commanded by a legendary character!

21
00:03:10,101 --> 00:03:12,296
Legendary? And who would that be?

22
00:03:13,221 --> 00:03:16,372
You’d never guess! The
famous Captain Blood!

23
00:03:16,621 --> 00:03:20,580
Blood?!
Don't tell me that Captain Blood..

24
00:03:20,621 --> 00:03:22,498
. ...is sinking Silverland's ships!
- Exactly!

25
00:03:22,541 --> 00:03:24,532
We even have eyewitnesses!

26
00:03:26,461 --> 00:03:30,295
Speak! Is it true that you saw
Captain Blood on that ship?

27
00:03:31,021 --> 00:03:33,660
Certainly, sir, with our own eyes!

28
00:03:36,621 --> 00:03:38,577
I can't believe it.

29
00:03:38,621 --> 00:03:42,091
Captain Blood has
helped me so many times...

30
00:03:58,621 --> 00:04:02,614
I always thought he was a
generous man, even if a bit rough.

31
00:04:02,941 --> 00:04:05,216
I hope those sailors were mistaken.

32
00:04:05,901 --> 00:04:10,531
Sapphire! I think something is
wrong with him. He looks so depressed!

33
00:04:11,021 --> 00:04:13,330
What happened to you?
What were you thinking about?

34
00:04:13,941 --> 00:04:18,219
About something that needs
to be verified first. Hold on tight!

35
00:04:35,061 --> 00:04:37,495
Wow, look at those beautiful ships!

36
00:04:51,021 --> 00:04:53,012
That should be the one!

37
00:04:56,461 --> 00:04:59,737
- Now he's going to look for Blood.
- Right!

38
00:05:14,021 --> 00:05:16,899
Yes, it's his ship, I recognize it.

39
00:05:20,461 --> 00:05:24,454
How strange... there's
not a living soul on deck!

40
00:05:36,701 --> 00:05:39,738
- Captain Blood!
- Hello, Sapphire!

41
00:05:40,941 --> 00:05:42,932
I recognized your ship.

42
00:05:43,021 --> 00:05:46,730
Why isn't there a sentry?
It could be dangerous!

43
00:05:48,261 --> 00:05:51,094
- So I didn't set a
sentry? Look behind you!

44
00:06:04,021 --> 00:06:06,012
- What was that, boatswain?

45
00:06:08,141 --> 00:06:11,656
- Nothing serious, I slipped
on the rail and fell into the sea!

46
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:22,256
- The boatswain has
been replaced, Grand Duke!

47
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:25,896
The secret of the ghost ship
won't be easily discovered!

48
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:28,853
- Better that way, because otherwise
we would receive a severe reprimand..

49
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:31,256
. from Mr. X.
- Shut up!

50
00:06:33,900 --> 00:06:36,495
- There is really nothing to
laugh about, Captain Blood!

51
00:06:37,020 --> 00:06:39,296
- But Sapphire, how
could I calmly frequent..

52
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:42,378
. the port of your Kingdom
if mine were the ghost ship?

53
00:06:43,020 --> 00:06:45,740
- And yet there are
sailors who can testify.

54
00:06:45,780 --> 00:06:48,454
Therefore you could be
arrested at any moment!

55
00:06:48,500 --> 00:06:51,254
- I don't think that would
be possible anymore!

56
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:54,098
- Good heavens!

57
00:06:55,780 --> 00:06:57,817
The ship has set sail!

58
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:04,095
Dammit!
I really didn't expect this!

59
00:07:04,380 --> 00:07:07,452
Hey, you two! Ready a new
lifeboat for my friends!

60
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:09,776
- Yes, sir! - A lifeboat?
- Prepare the sturdiest one

61
00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:12,016
...so they can reach the port
safe and sound.

62
00:07:12,100 --> 00:07:14,092
Captain Blood, wait!

63
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:17,771
We're not going back to land!
We will find the ghost ship

64
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,857
so we can prove
your innocence!

65
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:22,580
I refuse your offer!
The sea belongs only to men.

66
00:07:22,620 --> 00:07:25,692
...and a woman profanes it!
Crew, am I not right?

67
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:28,812
- Yes! Of course! It's true!
- What a backwards mentality!

68
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:32,171
- Anyway, I'm not going back home!
- You must obey my order!

69
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:34,894
No! I refuse
and I beg you not to insist!

70
00:07:34,940 --> 00:07:36,852
All right, Princess,
as you wish!

71
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:39,176
But don't complain,
I warned you!

72
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:42,891
Count on me! I'll work better
than anyone else on board!

73
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:46,415
Did you all hear that?
Show no special treatment!

74
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:48,372
You will treat her
like a member of the crew!

75
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:55,214
Come on, boys, it's your
first job! Wash these clothes!

76
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:57,297
You're not telling me that
we have to wash them all?

77
00:07:57,460 --> 00:08:00,692
- Of course! And then you'll sweep the deck!
- Fine. And after that?

78
00:08:03,020 --> 00:08:05,819
Prepare some food,
clean the masts...

79
00:08:10,580 --> 00:08:13,414
Get out of here!
Get out of here!

80
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,818
Away!

81
00:08:16,940 --> 00:08:19,136
What did you say
there was to do next?

82
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:22,299
Clean the mainmast!

83
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:42,616
What delicacies! What treats!

84
00:08:45,141 --> 00:08:47,780
Captain, this girl
is truly to be admired!

85
00:08:47,821 --> 00:08:51,097
She cooks well and she works
well. She's a respectable sailor!

86
00:08:51,141 --> 00:08:53,655
You're right. In my life
I have never seen a sailor..

87
00:08:53,701 --> 00:08:56,295
...so good and scrupulous
at doing his duty.

88
00:09:13,661 --> 00:09:16,334
I see nothing but sea!
We've been sailing for many days.

89
00:09:16,381 --> 00:09:18,611
Silverland is very far away now.

90
00:09:30,621 --> 00:09:34,819
I wonder what Dad
and Mom are doing, if they are thinking of me..!

91
00:09:34,981 --> 00:09:37,620
Of course they'll be thinking of you!
They'll be worried, in fact!

92
00:09:39,021 --> 00:09:41,979
You have worked well. It seems as if
they have assisted you with their thoughts.

93
00:09:42,021 --> 00:09:45,331
Don't you have any manners?
You must knock before entering!

94
00:09:45,661 --> 00:09:48,016
I did, but you were immersed
in your thoughts...

95
00:09:48,061 --> 00:09:50,814
...and you didn't notice!
- Listen, Captain!

96
00:09:50,901 --> 00:09:53,495
The time has come
to search for the ghost ship!

97
00:09:54,221 --> 00:09:57,133
That is what I will do.
And as soon as I've found it,

98
00:09:57,181 --> 00:10:00,617
I will take the necessary measures
so that it can no longer do harm.

99
00:10:01,461 --> 00:10:04,612
- The ghost ship is in sight!
- There it is!

100
00:10:05,421 --> 00:10:09,016
- Let's go see, quick!
- There it is!

101
00:10:17,581 --> 00:10:19,537
We would do well to get closer!

102
00:10:19,581 --> 00:10:22,459
No, it's dangerous!
Better to approach with a boat!

103
00:10:22,501 --> 00:10:24,412
All right. Prepare a lifeboat,

104
00:10:24,461 --> 00:10:26,577
Let's go take possession
of the ghost ship!

105
00:10:27,061 --> 00:10:31,339
- Hurrah!
- Hooray!

106
00:10:47,261 --> 00:10:49,855
Don't be afraid! It's
the electricity in the air...

107
00:10:49,901 --> 00:10:51,812
...clinging to the ship's masts!

108
00:10:59,261 --> 00:11:01,252
Is anyone on board?

109
00:11:01,901 --> 00:11:04,176
If there's no one there, say no!

110
00:11:08,181 --> 00:11:10,741
- Found anything strange?
- No, sir!

111
00:11:10,821 --> 00:11:12,812
It just seems like an abandoned ship.

112
00:11:13,741 --> 00:11:15,732
Now let's head back on board!

113
00:11:16,501 --> 00:11:18,731
Captain, something doesn't feel right!

114
00:11:33,661 --> 00:11:35,731
Oh, my goodness!

115
00:11:41,421 --> 00:11:43,491
It's not safe to stay here!

116
00:11:52,341 --> 00:11:54,901
I didn't expect to see you here!

117
00:11:57,221 --> 00:11:59,451
But you are the
ship's boatswain!

118
00:11:59,821 --> 00:12:02,255
No, brat,
I’m only his substitute.

119
00:12:02,301 --> 00:12:04,337
Now that you know
the secret of this ship,

120
00:12:04,381 --> 00:12:07,259
we cannot let you go.
Come out!

121
00:12:14,421 --> 00:12:16,730
Don’t worry,
we’ll keep you with us!

122
00:12:16,941 --> 00:12:19,933
You’re coming to Hell Island,
where we live!

123
00:12:20,101 --> 00:12:22,535
To Hell Island!

124
00:12:25,821 --> 00:12:27,891
Tink! Tink!

125
00:12:27,981 --> 00:12:30,654
Come at once
or we’re leaving without you!

126
00:12:34,541 --> 00:12:37,260
Have you seen Tink?
Where did he get to?

127
00:12:38,901 --> 00:12:42,530
I think he’s on the lifeboat
that left earlier.

128
00:12:42,621 --> 00:12:45,772
I searched the ship from top
to bottom, but I didn’t see a soul.

129
00:12:45,821 --> 00:12:47,891
Thanks for the search,
but now let’s go.

130
00:13:03,101 --> 00:13:06,411
It was a trap! Watch out!
Take cover, quickly!

131
00:13:07,821 --> 00:13:09,698
Stay down!

132
00:13:13,141 --> 00:13:16,497
- Help!
- The ghost ship!

133
00:13:17,821 --> 00:13:21,416
- Let's save ourselves!
- Quick, let's run!

134
00:13:22,341 --> 00:13:25,014
- Let's run! Help!
- Help!

135
00:13:29,341 --> 00:13:32,890
Lower the mainsail!
Hard to starboard! Ready to fire!

136
00:13:40,501 --> 00:13:42,378
Men, ready: fire!

137
00:13:43,821 --> 00:13:46,016
Aim for the powder magazine!
Fire!

138
00:13:47,101 --> 00:13:49,012
Take this!

139
00:14:03,821 --> 00:14:05,732
Old sailor..!

140
00:14:07,141 --> 00:14:09,735
This is my last wish,
Sapphire:

141
00:14:09,781 --> 00:14:12,500
Sink the ghost ship!

142
00:14:15,661 --> 00:14:17,811
- Damn you, ghost ship!
- Captain!

143
00:14:27,661 --> 00:14:31,449
- It hit the powder magazine!
- Hurrah!

144
00:14:31,501 --> 00:14:34,140
- Captain, you're great!
- Captain!

145
00:14:34,181 --> 00:14:37,730
- The ship has turned about!
- Let's chase it!

146
00:14:42,101 --> 00:14:44,092
Damn it! It's getting away from us!

147
00:14:45,901 --> 00:14:49,132
It doesn't end here, I'll
make you pay, ghost ship!

148
00:15:16,941 --> 00:15:20,616
This is the rum you liked
so much. And it's top-shelf!

149
00:15:22,221 --> 00:15:24,894
Goodbye, old man!
We'll miss you!

150
00:15:44,461 --> 00:15:47,214
Have you not spotted
the ghost ship yet?

151
00:15:47,301 --> 00:15:50,179
No! I only see
a seagull flying!

152
00:15:54,381 --> 00:15:56,372
What?! A letter?!

153
00:16:00,141 --> 00:16:02,894
I was captured
by a ghost ship.

154
00:16:03,021 --> 00:16:06,616
And taken to an island
called Hell Island!

155
00:16:06,781 --> 00:16:08,772
It's a terrifying place!

156
00:16:08,941 --> 00:16:12,456
There are many men with many weapons
standing guard!

157
00:16:12,661 --> 00:16:15,573
Not even a shark
can get close.

158
00:16:16,141 --> 00:16:19,292
Any ship that enters the bay
is destroyed!

159
00:16:19,581 --> 00:16:21,572
Stay away from here!

160
00:16:21,621 --> 00:16:25,011
I hope this letter
is read by Sapphire!

161
00:16:41,381 --> 00:16:44,134
Try the batteries
of the ghost ship!

162
00:16:50,341 --> 00:16:52,252
Remember...

163
00:16:53,541 --> 00:16:56,419
You must reach the ship
where Sapphire is on board!

164
00:16:56,941 --> 00:16:59,535
So their base
would be Hell Island!

165
00:16:59,581 --> 00:17:02,095
- Do you know it?
- Of course I know it!

166
00:17:02,221 --> 00:17:04,132
It's surrounded
by steep cliffs..

167
00:17:04,181 --> 00:17:06,741
...and has only one inlet
that allows ships to dock!

168
00:17:07,821 --> 00:17:09,812
It's an ideal place to hide

169
00:17:10,141 --> 00:17:13,611
Wait, there's something else!
It says the boatswain is a spy!

170
00:17:13,661 --> 00:17:16,221
I can't believe it!
How can he say these things?

171
00:17:18,301 --> 00:17:20,098
Watch out!

172
00:17:23,221 --> 00:17:25,212
It's the boatswain himself!

173
00:17:25,421 --> 00:17:28,618
I will always be grateful to you, Sapphire,
you saved my life!

174
00:17:30,301 --> 00:17:32,895
Hell Island
is a volcanic island.

175
00:17:33,141 --> 00:17:35,939
The water around the island
is so hot that it boils!

176
00:17:36,621 --> 00:17:39,340
One side of the island
is a very steep cliff.

177
00:17:39,421 --> 00:17:41,935
We will attack there
and surprise them!

178
00:17:42,021 --> 00:17:44,012
That way we will penetrate their lair!

179
00:17:57,901 --> 00:18:01,689
Careful, Sapphire! Hold onto me
or you'll end up overboard!

180
00:18:05,581 --> 00:18:07,651
Ashore, quickly!

181
00:18:08,501 --> 00:18:10,537
Everyone ashore!

182
00:18:24,901 --> 00:18:26,812
Don't look down, Sapphire!

183
00:18:28,981 --> 00:18:31,017
Watch out, there's a sentry!

184
00:18:31,701 --> 00:18:33,896
Be quiet or he'll notice us!

185
00:18:58,781 --> 00:19:02,740
Thanks to your help, the ghost
operation is going perfectly.

186
00:19:02,781 --> 00:19:04,817
But this is only the beginning!

187
00:19:04,861 --> 00:19:08,615
Tonight we drink to
celebrate our next conquest!

188
00:19:09,421 --> 00:19:12,618
No one can attack as long
as we stay on this island!

189
00:19:13,421 --> 00:19:15,412
What the hell is happening?

190
00:19:20,221 --> 00:19:22,974
Look, look,
a party of ghosts!

191
00:19:24,141 --> 00:19:26,132
We'll take them all out!

192
00:19:33,021 --> 00:19:35,171
My brave men, kill him!

193
00:19:54,101 --> 00:19:56,092
Dammit!
Take this!

194
00:20:04,621 --> 00:20:06,976
Sapphire, chase him!
Don't let him escape!

195
00:20:07,141 --> 00:20:09,052
We'll take care of the others!

196
00:20:16,701 --> 00:20:18,851
I will annihilate you, you bastard!

197
00:20:43,941 --> 00:20:45,977
The boss has been killed! Let's run!

198
00:20:46,421 --> 00:20:48,537
Forward, boys!
Give them no rest!

199
00:21:00,101 --> 00:21:02,899
Captain, we are winning!
It's a great victory!

200
00:21:03,781 --> 00:21:05,692
Captain Blood...

201
00:21:06,101 --> 00:21:11,459
Finally! You have the proof of my innocence, Princess Sapphire!

202
00:21:12,221 --> 00:21:14,212
Certainly, I have the proof!

203
00:21:15,101 --> 00:21:16,978
Sapphire!

204
00:21:20,901 --> 00:21:22,812
Well done, Tink!
Thanks to your letter..

205
00:21:22,861 --> 00:21:24,897
...we have avenged the shipwrecked sailors!

206
00:21:25,301 --> 00:21:28,179
What is it, Captain Blood?
Nothing serious, I hope!

207
00:21:28,741 --> 00:21:32,495
Don't worry about me, you know that I am immortal!

208
00:21:52,661 --> 00:21:54,936
Now you two will return home.

209
00:21:55,621 --> 00:21:58,772
My men will accompany you with the ghost ship.

210
00:21:59,421 --> 00:22:03,255
But Captain, I am worried about this wound! It must be treated!

211
00:22:04,261 --> 00:22:06,616
It's a trifle! I'm fine!

212
00:22:06,821 --> 00:22:09,699
Rather, you must hurry to set sail for Silverland,

213
00:22:09,741 --> 00:22:12,130
where you will have to face the enemies of your Kingdom!

214
00:22:12,301 --> 00:22:15,691
- Captain...!
- Go away, please! Go!

215
00:22:17,101 --> 00:22:18,978
All right...

216
00:22:20,021 --> 00:22:22,137
It's my fault they wounded him!

217
00:22:23,421 --> 00:22:25,412
What a magnificent man!

218
00:22:30,021 --> 00:22:32,012
Set sail!

219
00:22:34,941 --> 00:22:39,571
- Goodbye, Princess!
- Bye, Tink! Bye!

220
00:22:41,781 --> 00:22:44,454
- How do you feel, Captain?
- I can make it, friends!

221
00:22:48,181 --> 00:22:50,979
Goodbye and see you soon, Captain!

222
00:22:58,621 --> 00:23:00,930
He is very kind and so generous!

223
00:23:48,340 --> 00:23:51,960
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

224
00:23:51,961 --> 00:23:55,321
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

225
00:23:55,322 --> 00:23:59,092
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

226
00:23:59,093 --> 00:24:02,254
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

227
00:24:02,255 --> 00:24:06,068
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

228
00:24:06,069 --> 00:24:09,365
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

229
00:24:09,366 --> 00:24:13,371
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

230
00:24:13,372 --> 00:24:16,810
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

231
00:24:16,811 --> 00:24:20,431
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

232
00:24:20,432 --> 00:24:23,792
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

233
00:24:23,793 --> 00:24:27,563
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

234
00:24:27,564 --> 00:24:30,725
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

235
